OL,3,C'I thought she'd died': Mum relives
OL,4,Cmoment 6-year-old was seriously injured
OL,6,FThe mother of a six-year-old girl
OL,7,Fseriously injured in a collision with
OL,8,Fa motorbike has described the moment
OL,9,Fshe believed her daughter had died,
OL,10,Funtil she felt her heart still beating
OL,11,Fbeneath her chest.
OL,13,FTwo weeks after the crash in Tamworth,
OL,14,FSienna remains in Birmingham
OL,15,FChildren's Hospital with life-changing
OL,16,Finjuries, unable to walk or talk as
OL,17,Fdoctors monitor her recovery.
OL,19,FHer mother, Kayleigh Cope, said she
OL,20,Fknew something was badly wrong the
OL,21,Fmoment she heard the collision.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/7
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
