OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1785316717
OL,3,C'I thought she'd died': Mum relives
OL,4,Cmoment 6-year-old was seriously injured
OL,6,F"It sounded like a plane crashing to
OL,7,Fthe ground," she told ITV News Central.
OL,9,FRushing to the scene, she feared the
OL,10,Fworst.
OL,12,F"My first instinct was she's dead
OL,13,Fbecause of how she looked," she said.
OL,15,F"The bike was in two halves. She was
OL,16,Fobviously thrown. Her head was gashed
OL,17,Fopen. Her eyes were open. She was
OL,18,Funconscious, covered in blood."
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/7
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,349,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1785316717
OL,3,C'I thought she'd died': Mum relives
OL,4,Cmoment 6-year-old was seriously injured
OL,6,FAs people called for an ambulance, Ms
OL,7,FCope said she realised the last thing
OL,8,FSienna might hear was panic.
OL,10,F"I remember shouting, 'She's dying.'
OL,12,F"Then something clicked in my head and
OL,13,FI thought the last words she's going
OL,14,Fto hear is not me saying she's dying."
OL,16,FInstead, she leaned close to her
OL,17,Fdaughter and began whispering about
OL,18,Fthe things she loved.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/7
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,349,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1785316717
OL,3,C'I thought she'd died': Mum relives
OL,4,Cmoment 6-year-old was seriously injured
OL,6,F"We started whispering in her ear
OL,7,Fabout the things she likes...the
OL,8,Fanimals she wanted...and saying, 'When
OL,9,Fyou're better, we can go and get
OL,10,Fanother pet.'
OL,12,F"It was only feeling Sienna's heart
OL,13,Fbeating through her chest that gave me
OL,14,Fhope she could be saved."
OL,16,FSienna suffered a broken jaw, a
OL,17,Ffracture at the top of her spine and a
OL,18,Fpartially collapsed lung.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/7
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,349,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1785316717
OL,3,C'I thought she'd died': Mum relives
OL,4,Cmoment 6-year-old was seriously injured
OL,6,FDoctors believe those injuries will
OL,7,Fheal but the biggest uncertainty is
OL,8,Fthe brain injury she suffered in the
OL,9,Fcollision.
OL,11,F"She's awake. She's obviously
OL,12,Ffrustrated and agitated," Ms Cope said.
OL,14,F"She's not talking. We think that's to
OL,15,Fdo with the brain injury.
OL,17,F"The doctors said it would take time
OL,18,Ffor the brain to heal."
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G5/7
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,349,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1785316717
OL,3,C'I thought she'd died': Mum relives
OL,4,Cmoment 6-year-old was seriously injured
OL,6,FAsked what it would mean to hear her
OL,7,Fdaughter speak again, she replied: "It
OL,8,Fwould be the best thing ever."
OL,10,FA 20-year-old man has been charged
OL,11,Fwith six offences following the
OL,12,Fcollision.
OL,14,FCorey Griffiths, of Tamworth, is
OL,15,Fcharged with causing serious injury by
OL,16,Fdangerous driving, failing to stop
OL,17,Fafter a road accident, failing to
OL,18,Freport a road accident, using a motor
OL,19,Fvehicle without insurance, driving
OL,20,Fotherwise than in accordance with a
OL,21,Flicence and handling stolen goods.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G6/7
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,349,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34807
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F348A1785316717
OL,3,C'I thought she'd died': Mum relives
OL,4,Cmoment 6-year-old was seriously injured
OL,6,FA 16-year-old boy who was also
OL,7,Farrested has been released on
OL,8,Fconditional bail.
OL,10,FThe collision happened on a footpath
OL,11,Facross a playing field near Cambrian
OL,12,Fat around 4.20pm on 13 July, when a
OL,13,Fblack motorbike carrying a rider and
OL,14,Fpassenger collided with Sienna, who
OL,15,Fwas riding her bicycle.
OL,17,FHer injuries are described as serious
OL,18,Fbut stable and are believed to be
OL,19,Fpotentially life-changing.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G7/7
